  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-fletching-tables.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Fletching-Tables\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h3>更多製箭台</h3>\n<p>現在每種木材都擁有專屬的製箭台，請為你的建築增添色彩繽紛的工作空間，供你與製箭師村民使用。</p>\n<h6><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/klql4.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1672\" height=\"854\">所有木材類型的製箭台，上方分別放置對應的<em>弓變體</em>&sup1;，側面插著<em>箭矢變體</em>&sup1;。<br>&sup1;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-weapon-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多武器變體</a></h6>\n<h3><br>在 Minecraft 中新增 11 款全新製箭台。</h3>\n<hr>\n<h2>相容於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a> 1.3.0+ 的方塊替換功能：</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/6zi3u.png\" alt=\"\"><br>透過沙漠村莊製箭師的窗戶向外看：我們可以看到，遊戲現在生成村莊時，不再使用<em>樺木製箭台</em>、<em>橡木火把</em>和<em>橡木梯子</em>，而是改為<em><strong>叢林木製箭台</strong></em>、<em><strong>叢林木火把</strong></em>（來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-torch-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多火把變體</a>）以及<em><strong>叢林木梯子</strong></em>（來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnemos-more-ladder-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nemo 的更多梯子變體</a>）。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
